## Executive Summary

GreenFlow Utilities Inc. is a leading provider of electricity and water services in the Midwest region. Our operations encompass a wide range of activities including power generation, distribution, and water treatment. This report outlines the current state of our operations, key performance indicators (KPIs), and strategic initiatives to enhance efficiency and sustainability.

---

## 1. Overview of Operations

GreenFlow Utilities Inc. operates through two primary divisions: Electricity Services and Water Services. Each division is responsible for specific components of our utility offerings, working collaboratively to ensure seamless service delivery to our customers.

### 1.1 Electricity Services

The Electricity Services division is responsible for the generation and distribution of electrical power across five states: Illinois, Indiana, Iowa, Missouri, and Wisconsin.

### 1.2 Water Services

The Water Services division manages the treatment and distribution of potable water to our residential and commercial clients in the Springfield metropolitan area.

