## 4. Current Projects and Initiatives

### 4.1 Electricity Services Initiatives

#### 4.1.1 Smart Grid Implementation

GreenFlow is investing in a Smart Grid system to improve energy efficiency and reliability. This project, initiated in January 2023, aims to reduce outages and optimize energy distribution.

- **Projected Completion:** December 2024
- **Budget:** $15 million
- **Partners:** Siemens AG (technology provider), Local Government

### 4.2 Water Services Initiatives

#### 4.2.1 Infrastructure Upgrades

To enhance water quality and reduce leakage, we are undertaking a comprehensive upgrade of our pipeline infrastructure. This project will address aging pipes and ensure compliance with EPA standards.

- **Start Date:** March 2023
- **Completion Date:** November 2024
- **Budget:** $10 million
- **Contractor:** AquaSolutions LLC

